I'm wanting to transfer bones files from a SysV Unix Machine to a
BSD Unix machine.  Both machines are running Nethack 3.0j with 
identical compiler options except for the unix type and the size
of uchar and schar (changed them to short ints).  Also, the SysV system
has STUPID_CPP defined, while the BSD system does not.

This would make the game far more enjoyable if we could just trade
bones files; we already share our high score lists.
